OL,1,Vk4                               G4/9
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGFIERCE FIGHTING IN
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGNORTHERN IRAQ
OL,4,D
OL,5, Fierce fighting is reported to be
OL,6, continuing in northern Iraq, with
OL,7, conflicting claims over who is in
OL,8, control of the oil city of Kirkuk.
OL,10,FKurdish rebels say they have retaken it
OL,11,Fafter an onslaught by government troops
OL,12,Fbriefly drove them out.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FBaghdad says its forces have regained
OL,15,FKirkuk and remain in control.
OL,17,FThe US state department confirmed that
OL,18,FIraqi troops seemed to be in control.
OL,19,F
OL,20,FReports say several oil fields were
OL,21,Fapparently set on fire during clashes.
OL,22,F
OL,23,D]FFromG30-03-91F/ teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,182,190,120,250,0,100
