OL,1,Vk4                               G6/9
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGGULF STATES TO CUT AID
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGTO JORDAN & PLO
OL,4,D
OL,5, The Gulf Cooperation Council has said
OL,6, it is suspending aid to Jordan and the
OL,7, PLO because of their support for Iraq
OL,8, during the Gulf crisis.F
OL,10,FThe GCC represents six Arab nations and
OL,11,Fits secretary general Abdullah Beshara
OL,12,Fis a Kuwaiti.
OL,13,F
OL,14,FAnnouncing the move he said there could
OL,15,Fbe "no forgiveness, no forgetting".
OL,17,FHe said the GCC states - Saudi Arabia,
OL,18,FKuwait, Bahrain, Oman, Qatar and the
OL,19,FUnited Arab Emirates - could not
OL,20,Fsupport Amman and the PLO after they
OL,21,Fhad turned their backs on them.
OL,22,F
OL,23,D]FFromG30-03-91F/ teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
