OL,1,Vk4                               G9/9
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGMP SIR JOHN STRADLING
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGTHOMAS DIES
OL,4,D
OL,5, Conservative MP Sir John Stradling
OL,6, Thomas has died, aged 65.
OL,8,FHis agent, James Holloway, said the
OL,9,FMonmouth MP had been ill for a short
OL,10,Fwhile and died yesterday at the
OL,11,FWestminster Hospital in London.
OL,12,F
OL,13,FSir John was to retire at the next
OL,14,Fgeneral election. He had represented
OL,15,FMonmouth since 1970, where he had a
OL,16,Fmajority of 9,350.
OL,17,F
OL,18,FPaying tribute, Labour leader Neil
OL,19,FKinnock, himself a Welsh MP, said Sir
OL,20,FJohn was a man "who won genuine respect
OL,21,Fand friendship across the Commons".
OL,22,F
OL,23,D]FFromG30-03-91F/ teletextarchive.com
